<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Unstack Your Payment Stack</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --black: #020408;
    --blue: #1A6BFF;
    --blue-glow: #3A8AFF;
    --blue-dim: rgba(26, 107, 255, 0.15);
    --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    --glass-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    --text-primary: #F0F4FF;
    --text-muted: rgba(200, 210, 240, 0.55);
  }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    background: var(--black);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    cursor: default;
  }

  /* ── LOADING SCREEN ── */
  #loader {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 9999;
    background: #020408;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 32px;
    transition: opacity 0.8s ease, visibility 0.8s ease;
  }
  #loader.hidden { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; pointer-events: none; }

  .loader-wordmark {
    font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .loader-bar-wrap {
    width: 280px;
    height: 2px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border-radius: 2px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .loader-bar {
    height: 100%;
    width: 0%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue), var(--blue-glow));
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: width 0.1s linear;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--blue-glow);
  }

  .loader-pct {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* ── GLOBAL NOISE OVERLAY ── */
  body::after {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.03'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 100;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  /* ── NAVBAR ── */
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 500;
    padding: 20px 60px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: rgba(2, 4, 8, 0.7);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }

  .nav-logo {
    font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-logo span { color: var(--blue-glow); }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.25s;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: white; }

  .nav-cta {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(26,107,255,0.4);
    background: rgba(26,107,255,0.08);
    color: var(--blue-glow);
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.25s;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover {
    background: rgba(26,107,255,0.2);
    border-color: var(--blue-glow);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(26,107,255,0.25);
  }

  /* ── HERO HEADLINE ── */
  .hero-headline-wrap {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    padding: 160px 60px 60px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue-glow);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before, .eyebrow::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 36px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--blue-glow);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(52px, 7vw, 108px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    text-shadow:
      0 0 60px rgba(58, 138, 255, 0.35),
      0 0 120px rgba(58, 138, 255, 0.15),
      0 0 200px rgba(58, 138, 255, 0.08);
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
  }

  h1 em {
    font-style: normal;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #A8C8FF 0%, #1A6BFF 50%, #6B9FFF 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  /* ── SCROLL SECTION (STICKY CANVAS) ── */
  #scroll-section {
    position: relative;
    height: 5000px;
  }

  .sticky-container {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Vignette / atmospheric gradient */
  .sticky-container::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 50% 50%, transparent 40%, rgba(2,4,8,0.7) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* Bottom fade into next section */
  .sticky-container::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 180px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--black));
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 3;
  }

  #terminal-canvas {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    mix-blend-mode: screen;
  }

  /* Scroll progress indicator */
  .scroll-progress-bar {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 24px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 5;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .scroll-progress-track {
    width: 1px;
    height: 60px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .scroll-progress-fill {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--blue), transparent);
    height: 0%;
    transition: height 0.1s linear;
  }
  .scroll-hint-text {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
  }

  /* ── FRAME COUNTER BADGE ── */
  .frame-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    right: 32px;
    z-index: 5;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  }

  /* ── AFTER-SCROLL SECTION ── */
  .outro-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 120px 60px;
    text-align: center;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .outro-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -200px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(26,107,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .outro-label {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue-glow);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .outro-headline {
    font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 62px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: white;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
  }

  .outro-sub {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    padding: 18px 44px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A6BFF, #4A90FF);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 30px rgba(26,107,255,0.4),
      0 0 60px rgba(26,107,255,0.15),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  }
  .cta-btn::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.12), transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .cta-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 50px rgba(26,107,255,0.55),
      0 0 100px rgba(26,107,255,0.2),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  }
  .cta-btn:active { transform: translateY(0px); }

  .cta-arrow {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-right: 2px solid white;
    border-top: 2px solid white;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    transition: transform 0.2s;
    margin-top: -2px;
  }
  .cta-btn:hover .cta-arrow { transform: rotate(45deg) translate(2px, -2px); }

  /* ── FEATURES GRID ── */
  .features-section {
    padding: 20px 60px 120px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .features-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue-glow);
    opacity: 0.8;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(10,16,35,0.95) 0%, rgba(4,8,18,0.98) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 40px 36px 40px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    cursor: default;
  }

  /* Glowing top accent bar */
  .feature-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, var(--blue) 40%, var(--blue-glow) 60%, transparent 100%);
    opacity: 0.6;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
  }

  /* Subtle radial glow behind icon */
  .feature-card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -40px; left: -40px;
    width: 200px; height: 200px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(26,107,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(26,107,255,0.25);
    box-shadow:
      0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(26,107,255,0.1),
      0 0 40px rgba(26,107,255,0.06);
  }
  .feature-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .feature-card:hover::after  { opacity: 1; }

  /* Step number */
  .feature-step {
    font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue-glow);
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .feature-step::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 20px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--blue-glow);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  /* Icon container with glow bg */
  .feature-icon-wrap {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,107,255,0.15), rgba(26,107,255,0.04));
    border: 1px solid rgba(26,107,255,0.2);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    transition: background 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .feature-card:hover .feature-icon-wrap {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,107,255,0.22), rgba(26,107,255,0.08));
    border-color: rgba(26,107,255,0.35);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
  }

  .feature-title {
    font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .feature-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Bottom learn-more link */
  .feature-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--blue-glow);
    opacity: 0;
    margin-top: 24px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.25s ease, gap 0.2s ease;
  }
  .feature-link::after {
    content: '→';
    font-size: 14px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .feature-card:hover .feature-link { opacity: 1; }
  .feature-card:hover .feature-link::after { transform: translateX(3px); }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    padding: 40px 60px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }
  .footer-logo {
    font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
  }
  .footer-logo span { color: rgba(26,107,255,0.5); }
  .footer-copy {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  /* Parallax depth layer */
  .depth-layer {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 80% at 50% 0%, rgba(26,107,255,0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }



  /* ── LOGO IMAGES ── */
  .nav-logo-img {
    height: 38px;
    width: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .footer-logo-img {
    height: 28px;
    width: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: contain;
    opacity: 0.45;
    filter: grayscale(20%);
  }

  .loader-logo-img {
    height: 32px;
    width: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: contain;
    opacity: 0.55;
    filter: grayscale(30%);
  }

  /* Remove old logo font styles */
  .nav-logo {
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .loader-wordmark {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }


  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    nav { padding: 16px 24px; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    .hero-headline-wrap { padding: 120px 24px 40px; }
    h1 { font-size: 44px; }
    .outro-section, .features-section { padding: 80px 24px; }
    .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Depth atmosphere -->
<div class="depth-layer"></div>

<!-- LOADER -->
<div id="loader">
  <div class="loader-wordmark"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Payswitch" class="loader-logo-img"></div>
  <div>
    <div class="loader-bar-wrap">
      <div class="loader-bar" id="loaderBar"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="loader-pct" id="loaderPct">Loading experience — 0%</div>
</div>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a href="#" class="nav-logo"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Payswitch" class="nav-logo-img"></a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#">Product</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Pricing</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Developers</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Company</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a href="#" class="nav-cta">Get Started</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO HEADLINE -->
<div class="hero-headline-wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">AI-Powered Payments Intelligence</div>
  <h1>Look inside your<br><em>payments stack</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Upload your payment documents. Our AI audits your entire stack — then connects you with industry experts to act on every finding.</p>
</div>

<!-- SCROLL SECTION -->
<section id="scroll-section">
  <div class="sticky-container">
    <canvas id="terminal-canvas"></canvas>

    <div class="frame-badge" id="frameBadge">FRAME 001 / 120</div>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-word right" id="word-1">
      <div class="scroll-word-inner">
        <span class="word-label">Terminals</span>
        <span class="word-line"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-word left" id="word-2">
      <div class="scroll-word-inner">
        <span class="word-label">Acceptance</span>
        <span class="word-line"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-word right" id="word-3">
      <div class="scroll-word-inner">
        <span class="word-label">Routing</span>
        <span class="word-line"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-progress-bar">
      <div class="scroll-hint-text">Scroll</div>
      <div class="scroll-progress-track">
        <div class="scroll-progress-fill" id="scrollFill"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- OUTRO -->
<section class="outro-section">
  <p class="outro-label">Upload. Analyse. Optimise.</p>
  <h2 class="outro-headline">Your AI payments audit,<br>ready in minutes.</h2>
  <p class="outro-sub">Upload a few documents. Our AI identifies every fee, routing inefficiency and acceptance gap — then expert consultants guide you through exactly what to fix.</p>
  <a href="#" class="cta-btn">
    Start for free
    <span class="cta-arrow"></span>
  </a>
</section>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<section class="features-section">
  <p class="features-label">How it works</p>
  <div class="features-grid">

    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-step">Step 01</div>
      <div class="feature-icon-wrap">
        <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <rect x="2" y="6" width="22" height="15" rx="2.5" stroke="#3A8AFF" stroke-width="1.4"/>
          <rect x="2" y="10" width="22" height="4" fill="#1A6BFF" opacity="0.25"/>
          <rect x="5" y="17" width="6" height="1.5" rx="0.75" fill="#3A8AFF"/>
          <circle cx="20" cy="7" r="4" fill="#020408"/>
          <circle cx="20" cy="7" r="3" fill="#1A6BFF" opacity="0.15" stroke="#3A8AFF" stroke-width="1.2"/>
          <path d="M18.5 7l1 1 2-2" stroke="#3A8AFF" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-title">AI Payment Audit</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">Upload statements, contracts and gateway reports. Our AI maps your entire payment stack and surfaces every cost, gap and inefficiency within minutes.</div>
      <a href="#" class="feature-link">Learn more</a>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-step">Step 02</div>
      <div class="feature-icon-wrap">
        <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <circle cx="13" cy="10" r="5" stroke="#3A8AFF" stroke-width="1.4"/>
          <path d="M7 22c0-3.314 2.686-6 6-6h0c3.314 0 6 2.686 6 6" stroke="#3A8AFF" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <path d="M19 8l2-2M19 12h2M17 6l1.5-1.5" stroke="#3A8AFF" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.6"/>
        </svg>
